The numbers is a list of 2, 1, 3, 4, and 4.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The prefixes is a list of 5 zeros.
The suffixes is a list of 5 zeros.
Set item 0 of prefixes to item 0 of numbers.
For every spot from 1 to last.
Set item spot of prefixes to item (spot minus 1) of prefixes.
If item spot of numbers is more than item spot of prefixes, set item spot of prefixes to item spot of numbers.

Set item last of suffixes to item last of numbers.
For every spot from last minus 1 to 0 by -1.
Set item spot of suffixes to item (spot plus 1) of suffixes.
If item spot of numbers is less than item spot of suffixes, set item spot of suffixes to item spot of numbers.

The chunks is 1.
For every split from 0 to last minus 1, if item split of prefixes is at most item (split plus 1) of suffixes, add 1 to chunks.
Show chunks.
